                                        "entry_id": "69ef0fcd-15df-31b3-965d-74db4bfe7920",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A large device, in the form of a tower-shaped building, in which warm water is cooled by evaporation caused by circulating currents of air"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a47b844-e712-43fd-8182-b432e6adfa4c",
                                                "sense_id": "7e5229dd-798a-3071-ac04-a89f33ff29d1",
                                                "text": "So we'll march day and night\nBy the big cooling tower\nThey have the plant\nBut we have the power"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
